invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_mont64.h
catches: test/widemul-builds.sh
reason: a clang build for x86-64 runs rsa_mont64_addcarry.c's rows too,
  where decision 122 keeps it on the loops' compare form of the step.
  test/widemul-builds.sh compiles rsa_mont64.c with the pinned clang for
  x86-64, whatever the host, and requires that neither entry calls the
  rows.

--- old
#if defined(__x86_64__) && defined(__GNUC__) && !defined(__clang__)
#define RSA_MONT64_ADDCARRY 1
--- new
#if defined(__x86_64__) && defined(__GNUC__)
#define RSA_MONT64_ADDCARRY 1
